t  would get its own house seat because  it's about the size of a House District  and it would be represented by Maryland  senators what it wouldn't get is two new  Democratic senators that's what this is  all about okay and real quick on  Elizabeth Warren I know she has proposed  a wealth tax she wants to raise taxes  and she also wants to she wants to break  up companies want to break up technology  companies and tries to break up banks is  there anything else we should understand  if she is the key economic voice well I  think that Ronald Reagan's old line  about democratic economic policy would  apply to senator war and other Democrats  are going to be influencing Joe Biden if  it moves tax it if it keeps moving  regulated if it dies subsidize it that's  their economic policy all right senator  it's good to have you this morning thank  you so much for joining us Senator Tom  cotton we'll see you soon sir thank you

